# Keep the package store inside the repo.
#
# pnpm normally uses a global store (~/Library/pnpm/store on macOS). When a
# process cannot write to that location — a sandboxed agent, a locked-down CI
# runner — pnpm silently switches stores and then refuses to reuse the existing
# node_modules linkage with ERR_PNPM_UNEXPECTED_STORE. Pinning a repo-local,
# gitignored store makes every environment resolve the same one.
store-dir=.pnpm-store
